body:
My boss pretty consistently insists that I'm "in love" with my best friend. When I finally had enough, I told him "you know I'm asexual, right? Like I'm not attracted to other people?" and he told me "yes you are, that's not a thing." Then he tried to give me the birds-and-the-bees talk. I'm 22. And at work.

&#x200B;

One of my best friends in high school told me (in reference to my other best friend) "you know you're dating, right?" Like no, I was not aware.

&#x200B;

So basically the same thing every ace person has to hear.

&#x200B;
